{"id":"chyotko","lemma":"чётко","pos":"adv","rank":4099,"glosses":["distinctly, clearly, audibly, legibly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Ru-%D1%87%D1%91%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%91%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я скажу тебе чётко, что сказать.","en":"I'll tell you exactly what to say.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to say, to tell"}]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, говорите медленно и чётко.","en":"Please speak slowly and clearly.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"slowly"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, говорите настолько чётко, насколько возможно.","en":"Please speak as clearly as possible.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"as"},null,{"g":"how much, how"},{"g":"perhaps"}]},{"text":"Говори чётко.","en":"Speak clearly.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"Скажи чётко.","en":"Say it clearly.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]}]}